  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xorwZ5Z.png\" alt=\"YUNG优化要塞\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"依赖YUNG's API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入YUNG帮派Discord！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"关注我的Twitter！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"订阅我的YouTube！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ePR2LMC.png\" alt=\"这是什么？\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;前所未有的Minecraft要塞全面重制，在保留原版风格的同时大幅提升复杂度和探索乐趣。包含超过15种独特房间、多种隧道走廊、楼梯陷阱甚至隐藏区域！</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gD7AqVZYgk0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zMhFcqM.png\" alt=\"兼容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">YUNG优化要塞与主流世界生成模组完全兼容，包括：</p><ul>\n<li><a style=\"background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-mineshafts-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG优化废弃矿井</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-dungeons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG优化地牢</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG扩展包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-bridges\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG桥梁</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>更好的末地</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>末地生态扩展</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>重构建筑</strong> - 该模组提供可选数据包，能将优化要塞改造后生成在下界和末地！<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-better-strongholds-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点此查看</a>&nbsp;<strong>请使用最新版重构建筑模组！！</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>拯救要塞！&nbsp;</strong>- 现已无需此模组！优化要塞已内置全部相关功能</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>末地重制版</strong> - 优化要塞会与末地传送门/城堡同时生成。新增的末影之眼可配合原版传送门框架使用。若需让末影之眼指向优化要塞，请在模组配置的<span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">eye_behavior</span>列表（1.18版本中名为<span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">eye_structure_list</span>）中添加<span style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\">betterstrongholds:stronghold</span>。末影之眼会自动追踪列表中最接近玩家的建筑。<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">注意：1.18.2+版本默认完全兼容，无需调整配置</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>其他情况 -&nbsp;</strong>若要塞未生成或出现在错误维度，请确保使用最新版优化要塞和YUNG's API</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"使用优惠码YUNGNICKYOUNG可享Bisect Hosting七五折！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
